  "title": "Corn Flake Cookies II",
  "description": "My mom&#39;s easy recipe--Chewy, yummy cookies with breakfast cereal flakes, chocolate chips and nuts...This recipe can be halved or doubled, depending on how many cookies you want! Enjoy!",
